    <body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.neaniskoi.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.neaniskoi.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:neaniskoi"><head>ΝΕΑΝΙΣΚΟΙ</head>
          <pb n="601" facs="urn:hathi:iau.31858007086675:scan:609"/>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="138" xml:id="frag_faa037ddf1" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:neaniskoi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.neaniskoi.nauck1889-grc1:146">
            <note type="source">Fuit tetralogiae Lycurgeae: vide ad Lycurgum. Athenaeus XI. p. 503 c.</note>
            <note type="commentary">Νίκανδρος δ' ὁ Θυατειρηνὸς καλεῖσθαί φησι ψυκτῆρας καὶ τοὺς ἀλσώδεις καὶ συσκίους τόπους τοὺς τοῖς θεοῖς ἀνειμένους ἐν οἷς ἐστιν ἀναψῦξαι. Αἰσχύλος Νεανίσκοις</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:id="frag_faa037ddf1-l1" xml:lang="grc">Σαύρας ὑποσκίοισιν ἐν ψυκτηρίοις.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="apparatus">Αὔρας Valckenarius ad Hippolytum p. 184 b.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="139" xml:id="frag_daab06a43e" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:neaniskoi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.neaniskoi.nauck1889-grc1:147">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀρείφατον λῆμα: ἰσχυρὸν, ἀντὶ, Ἄρει ἐοικός. Αἰσχύλος Νεανίσκοις.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="140" xml:id="frag_181f2ee1ee" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:neaniskoi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.neaniskoi.nauck1889-grc1:148">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἀφοίβαντον: ἀκάθαρτον. Αἰσχύλος Νεανίσκοις.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="141" xml:id="frag_de1cfbd1dc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:neaniskoi" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.neaniskoi.nauck1889-grc1:149">
            <note type="source">Photius p. 326, 15. Ὀκτώπαν ποταμὸν Αἰσχύλος διαπέπλευκε Νεανίσκοις. Hesychius, Ὀκτώπας : ποταμός.</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text>
